        "scene": "a1_stairs",
        "t": 1791842293703
      },
      {
        "choice": "\"You're welcome, Your Highness.\"",
        "ep": "s01e01",
        "scene": "a1_door",
        "t": 1791842362020
      },
      {
        "choice": "\"Fair warning. My mother's gonna feed you till you die. Sunday gravy, Wednesday gravy. You can't stop it. Nobody can.\"",
        "ep": "s01e01",
        "scene": "a1_room",
        "t": 1791842477417
      },
      {
        "choice": "Take it. Hug him, even though Kearney men don't. \"Thanks, Pop.\"",
        "ep": "s01e01",
        "scene": "a1_goodbye",
        "t": 1791842509380
      },
      {
        "choice": "Play it for laughs. \"I was an altar boy for four years. I'm banned from a Rita's Water Ice. My grandmother owns a gun.\"",
        "ep": "s01e01",
        "roll": {
          "dice": [
            5,
            6
          ],
          "kind": "move",
          "label": "Lie to the room (and Jules)",
          "nudged": false,
          "rewound": false,
          "tier": "strong"
        },
        "scene": "a2_floor_meeting",
        "t": 1791842582884
      },
      {
        "choice": "\"Never broken a rule. You're *here*. I heard your mother on the phone.\"",
        "ep": "s01e01",
        "scene": "a2_ttal_jules",
        "t": 1791842643767
      },
      {
        "choice": "Go meet Ciro about the delivery job, and work the Friday dinner rush.",
        "ep": "s01e01",
        "hub": true,
        "scene": "a2_hub",
        "t": 1791842722634
      },
      {
        "choice": "Work the doors. Smile, chat, remember names. Make them like you.",
